  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/gregory-thaumaturgus-canonical-epistle#GregThaum.EpCan.III.1.s1",
    "work_id": "anf-works/gregory-thaumaturgus-canonical-epistle",
    "canonical_ref": "GregThaum.EpCan.III.1.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Behold, did not Achar the son of Zara transgress in the accursed thing, and trouble then lighted on all the congregation of Israel?",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 258,
    "date_range": [
      254,
      262
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/gregory-thaumaturgus-canonical-epistle#GregThaum.EpCan.III.1.s2",
    "work_id": "anf-works/gregory-thaumaturgus-canonical-epistle",
    "canonical_ref": "GregThaum.EpCan.III.1.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And this one man was alone in his sin; but he was not alone in the death that came by his sin.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 258,
    "date_range": [
      254,
      262
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/gregory-thaumaturgus-canonical-epistle#GregThaum.EpCan.III.1.s3",
    "work_id": "anf-works/gregory-thaumaturgus-canonical-epistle",
    "canonical_ref": "GregThaum.EpCan.III.1.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And by us, too, everything of a gainful kind at this time, which is ours not in our own rightful possession, but as property strictly belonging to others, ought to be reckoned a thing devoted.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 258,
    "date_range": [
      254,
      262
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/gregory-thaumaturgus-canonical-epistle#GregThaum.EpCan.III.1.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/gregory-thaumaturgus-canonical-epistle",
    "canonical_ref": "GregThaum.EpCan.III.1.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For that Achar indeed took of the spoil; and those men of the present time take also of the spoil.",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 258,
    "date_range": [
      254,
      262
    ],
