    "canonical_ref": "GregThaum.EpCan.IV.1.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "“Thou shalt not see thy brother’s ox or his sheep go astray in the way, and pay no heed to them; but thou shalt in any wise bring them again unto thy brother.",
